# Compositions

Define compositions in `src/Root.tsx`. Use `type` (not `interface`) for props to ensure `defaultProps` type safety.

```tsx
import { Composition } from 'remotion';
import { MyComposition } from './MyComposition';

export const RemotionRoot = () => (
  <Composition
    id="MyComposition"
    component={MyComposition}
    durationInFrames={100}
    fps={30}
    width={1080}
    height={1080}
    defaultProps={{ title: 'Hello World' } satisfies MyCompositionProps}
  />
);
```

Use `<Folder>` to organize compositions. Use `<Still>` for single-frame images (no `durationInFrames`/`fps` needed).

Nest a composition inside another using `<Sequence width={W} height={H}>`:
```tsx
<AbsoluteFill>
  <Sequence width={COMPOSITION_WIDTH} height={COMPOSITION_HEIGHT}>
    <CompositionComponent />
  </Sequence>
</AbsoluteFill>
```

# calculateMetadata

Use `calculateMetadata` to dynamically set duration, dimensions, or props before rendering.

```tsx
import { CalculateMetadataFunction } from 'remotion';

const calculateMetadata: CalculateMetadataFunction<Props> = async ({ props, abortSignal }) => {
  const data = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/${props.videoId}`, { signal: abortSignal }).then(r => r.json());
  return {
    durationInFrames: Math.ceil(data.duration * 30),
    props: { ...props, videoUrl: data.url },
  };
};
```

Returnable fields: `durationInFrames`, `width`, `height`, `fps`, `props`, `defaultOutName`, `defaultCodec`.
The `abortSignal` cancels stale requests when props change in the Studio.

# Zod Parameters

Install zod **exactly version 3.22.3**:
```bash
npm i zod@3.22.3
```

Define schema alongside the component:
```tsx
import { z } from 'zod';

export const MyCompositionSchema = z.object({
  title: z.string(),
});

const MyComponent: React.FC<z.infer<typeof MyCompositionSchema>> = (props) => (
  <div><h1>{props.title}</h1></div>
);
```

Pass schema to composition:
```tsx
<Composition schema={MyCompositionSchema} defaultProps={{ title: 'Hello' }} ... />
```

## Color picker

```bash
npx remotion add @remotion/zod-types
```

```tsx
import { zColor } from '@remotion/zod-types';

export const MySchema = z.object({
  color: zColor(),
});
```
